# R4 fixtures (WP-21, R-FIX). Format: fixtures/r4/INDEX.md section 2.
# Written from docs/spec/format/08-data-model.md §11, 20-r4-resolver-constants.md §3, docs/spec/os/path.md and
# 12-vcs.md §2; every value is synthetic.
# fold_v1(x) = NFD(CF(NFD(x))) at Unicode 17.0.0 ([F20 §3.1]); ceq(a, b) = NFD(a) = NFD(b) ([F20 §3.4]).
# Computed from fixtures/ucd/17.0.0/UnicodeData.txt and CaseFolding.txt by a scratch implementation of §3.1
# that reproduces the NFD column of every NormalizationTest.txt line.

